{"title":"Harpy Talon","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Harpy, Fledgling Harpy, The Matriarch, The Shrieker</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"the-matriarch\" title=\"The Matriarch - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/a6ace642bb45e2618045.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Matriarch</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"fledgling-harpy\" title=\"Fledgling Harpy - dropped it in 42 of 67 looted corpses (1/1.6)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/5e20684bb6f8862fa4e7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fledgling Harpy</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.6<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"harpy\" title=\"Harpy - dropped it in 126 of 235 looted corpses (1/1.9)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/678b44f534ffde7b2c53.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Harpy</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.9<br>×1–7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"harpy-shrieker\" title=\"The Shrieker - dropped it in 1 of 2 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/4469953275ad75187dc2.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Shrieker</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map